            HOLDAWAY
            <span>
              FINANCIAL SERVICES.
            </span>
          </h2>


        </div>


      </div>



      <div class="project-case-grid project-case-grid-reverse">


        <div class="project-case-copy">


          <h3>
            THE BRIEF
          </h3>


          <p>

            Rebuild an existing financial planning website
            that no longer reflected the quality of the business.

            The original site worked, but visually it felt dated,
            generic and disconnected from the service being offered.

          </p>



          <h3>
            THE APPROACH
          </h3>


          <p>

            Keep the business professional and trustworthy,
            but remove the stiff corporate feel.

            Stronger structure, cleaner hierarchy,
            more intentional typography and a more modern visual identity.

          </p>



          <div class="project-tags">

            <span>
              REDESIGN
            </span>

            <span>
              PROFESSIONAL
            </span>

            <span>
              WEBSITE RESCUE
            </span>

