            connection and an individual coaching presence.

          </p>



          <h3>
            THE APPROACH
          </h3>


          <p>

            Warm colours, softer spacing, more emotional copy
            and a completely different visual rhythm from the other projects.

            Still structured. Still clear.
            Just intentionally more personal.

          </p>



          <div class="project-tags">

            <span>
